Package: qore-process-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-process-module-doc
Description: child process management module for Qore
 This module starts and supervises child processes, redirects their input and
 output, manages pipelines and process groups, and reads process and system
 resource information. Compiler metadata is included for Qore's tools.

