Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-process-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's process module
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example tests for Qore's
 process management module.
